<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gleason buys South Africa's Finance Week.</title>
<headline>Gleason buys South Africa's Finance Week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gleason Publications Ltd said on Monday it had bought Finance Week Holdings Ltd, owner of South African business magazine Finance Week, for an undisclosed sum and is on the hunt for new partners.</p>
<p>&quot;Negotiations between Gleason Publications and various potential international and local partners are in progress,&quot; the firm said.</p>
<p>It added further announcements would be made in due course.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
